iv class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-9-teaser-describedby-collapsed">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-9-teaser-describedby-expanded">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="true" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="basic" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-9-card0" data-csa-c-id="34lpq4-10xyii-cf96qd-go2ku8"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container a-reactive-container-transition"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized" data-a-max-height="300"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="de-DE" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>flacht die Handlung zunehmend ab. Der Spannungsbogen wird m.M.n. etwas zu sehr überdehnt. Zu Beginn war ich noch sehr angetan aber im weiteren Verlauf wollte man dann zu viel aus der Story herausholen. Insgesamt OK.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha a-hidden"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click" data-csa-c-id="rsc8s9-q45aev-yiscnc-9tfs4b"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon a-css-icon-draw a-css-icon-expand"></i></span><span class="a-see-more a-color-link"><span class="a-see-more-text">Mehr erfahren</span><span class="a-see-less-text">Weniger anzeigen</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="translationSpinner" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner-container_ypxf2"><div class="a-spinner-wrapper _Y3Itd_single-review-transl